================================================================================
UPSTREAM MODELS AND DATA
================================================================================

No model weights and no challenge data are distributed in this repository.

- DINOv2 (Apache-2.0), Oquab et al. 2023. The stage-1 encoder continues DINO
  self-distillation from the public vit_base_patch14_dinov2.lvd142m weights,
  loaded through timm (Apache-2.0). 144 of its 174 tensors remain bit-identical
  to those public weights; see experiments/results/dino_ssl_vitb_5fold/
  encoder_export_audit.json.

- FU_Biometry 2026 challenge data (CC BY-NC), from the organizers. Not
  redistributed. Any checkpoint trained on it is non-commercial.

- Fetal Biometry multicentre landmark dataset
  (FetalBiometry-Multicentre-Landmarks-2026; FP / UCL / HC18 subsets with
  expert landmark annotations). Used for EVALUATION AND CALIBRATION ONLY --
  the out-of-sample fit of the single HC ellipse-scale constant, and as a
  labelled proxy for the validation domain. Never trained on. No annotations of
  it were created by us and none of it is redistributed here. Its own README
  defers licensing to a LICENSE file that was not present in the copy we
  obtained, so no terms are asserted for it; obtain it, and its terms, from its
  authors.

- Built on PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause), timm (Apache-2.0), albumentations
  (MIT), OpenCV (Apache-2.0), NumPy / SciPy / pandas (BSD-3-Clause).

- Rejected encoder alternatives. experiments/encoders.py retains selectable
  code paths for USFM (BEiT-B/16 ultrasound SSL) and DINOv3 ViT-S/B/16, both of
  which were evaluated against the DINOv2 spine and rejected. Neither is used
  by the submitted system, neither is reachable from the container, and no
  weights for either are distributed here; both would have to be obtained
  separately, and the DINOv3 weights are gated under Meta's own DINOv3 licence.
  MedSapiens was triaged on paper only -- no code path for it exists here.
